{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0fed15dbc9f4efef","name":"Improviser Talent Trees","source":{"id":"source:reference-0fed15dbc9f4efef","title":"Improviser Talent Trees","revision":18277,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:53:28Z","sha256":"403187242a5f0951fe2f16462600e7f67d6bf6de1632505fc38eb59fbd8baf51","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18277","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Improviser%20Talent%20Trees&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0fed15dbc9f4efef","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At every odd-numbered level (1st, 3rd, 5th, and so on), an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improviser"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improviser","referenceId":"reference:bd9fa039fda6cb8e"}," gains an additional Improviser Talent. An ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improviser"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improviser","referenceId":"reference:bd9fa039fda6cb8e"}," may choose a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from any of the following Improviser Talent Trees they wish, but they must meet the prerequisites (if any) of the chosen Improviser Talent. No ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be selected more than once unless expressly indicated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Slicer Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Slicer_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:378b4a7c10892355"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You move like a ghost through the HoloNet, and can hack into enemy mainframes and computer systems with astonishing grace.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Outlaw Tech Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Outlaw_Tech_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:48f390b76e41547f"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrels"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrels"}," learn a variety of tricks that allow them to squeeze more life out of ailing technology, and they can enhance their gear in ways the manufacturer never intended.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Improviser Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improviser_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:4fc32b4db3ea6215"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You have mastered the ability to make something out of nothing, turning spare parts and scrap into a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sensor Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sensor_Pack","referenceId":"reference:0d0f0cdf6870cb1b"},", a weapon, or a protective suit of armor. You can build what you need on the fly, and sometimes your customized gear proves more useful than what you otherwise might have purchased.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Procurement Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Procurement_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:868d5a6d846be795"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You know how to find just what you need, no matter how far you are from civilization or how rare the item is. If you can't find it, you make it- but most of the time you find it.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
